cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "HEP-Trigger Quantization Lab"
authors:
  - name: "Piush Kole"
date-released: 2026-10-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Piush2004/hep-trigger-quantization-lab"
abstract: >
  A reproducible research platform investigating how post-training quantization
  and quantization-aware training affect the accuracy, model size, inference
  latency, and estimated hardware resource requirements of neural networks for
  real-time high-energy physics event classification. Independent research
  project inspired by publicly available HEP/trigger literature; not an
  official or CERN-affiliated effort.
